    {
      "subId": "1502412",
      "subQuestName": "Look for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150241201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150241201": {
            "id": "150241201",
            "speakerId": 1007,
            "speakerName": "Strange Machine",
            "text": "(There's some sort of a machine here. Probably used for weaving.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502413",
      "subQuestName": "Look for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150241301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150241301": {
            "id": "150241301",
            "speakerId": 1008,
            "speakerName": "Giant Woven Scroll",
            "text": "(This scroll has purposely been hung in the very middle of the ceiling. Whatever it means, it must be significant.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502411",
      "subQuestName": "Look for clues",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150241101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150241101": {
            "id": "150241101",
            "speakerId": 1009,
            "speakerName": "Stack of Woven Scrolls",
            "text": "(A large pile of woven scrolls. The thick layer of dust indicates that they've been here a long time.)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502414",
      "subQuestName": "Discuss countermeasures with Paimon",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [],
        "dialogs": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502406",
      "subQuestName": "Escape the sealed space",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150240601"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150240601": {
            "id": "150240601",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "You may begin whenever you're ready."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502407",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Biram",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150240701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150240701": {
            "id": "150240701",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew, we finally got out!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240702"
            ]
          },
          "150240702": {
            "id": "150240702",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "It is just as I thought. You are indeed capable of undertaking this mission.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240703"
            ]
          },
          "150240703": {
            "id": "150240703",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Did this prove your theory?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240704"
            ]
          },
          "150240704": {
            "id": "150240704",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Yes. You saw many distinctive-looking scrolls there, didn't you?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240705"
            ]
          },
          "150240705": {
            "id": "150240705",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sure did...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240706"
            ]
          },
          "150240706": {
            "id": "150240706",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "This specific kind of scroll was left to us by our ancestors. Upon investigation, I discovered what sets it apart is the use of a color not featured in ordinary scrolls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240707"
            ]
          },
          "150240707": {
            "id": "150240707",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "It is a most mysterious color that most people cannot even detect. I myself had to employ special techniques to confirm its existence.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240708"
            ]
          },
          "150240708": {
            "id": "150240708",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Yet there are those who are born with a natural ability to perceive it. And that is why I wanted to test you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240709"
            ]
          },
          "150240709": {
            "id": "150240709",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You mean...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240710"
            ]
          },
          "150240710": {
            "id": "150240710",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "That space you just entered was an exhibition room for storing this variety of woven scrolls.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240711"
            ]
          },
          "150240711": {
            "id": "150240711",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Centuries ago, a great shaman by the name of Huitzilin put in place a security measure, so that anyone who entered the room without permission would become trapped inside.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240712"
            ]
          },
          "150240712": {
            "id": "150240712",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "It exists to this day, and although I have not managed to decipher how it works, I have at least found out how to turn it on and off.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240713"
            ]
          },
          "150240713": {
            "id": "150240713",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Once someone is trapped inside, it is all but impossible for them to escape without outside help — unless they share the great shaman's ability to perceive that strange color.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240716"
            ]
          },
          "150240716": {
            "id": "150240716",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Clearly, you must have this ability... Which leads me to believe that our Iktomisaur Elder can sense this ability in people, and that it appoints a scroll-weaver on this basis.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240717"
            ]
          },
          "150240717": {
            "id": "150240717",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Another secret power? {NICKNAME}, you are full of mysteries...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240718"
            ]
          },
          "150240718": {
            "id": "150240718",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Still, having this ability doesn't change the fact that neither of us know where to start with weaving a scroll.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240719"
            ]
          },
          "150240719": {
            "id": "150240719",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Don't worry about that. The method for weaving this kind of scroll appears to be largely the same as for an ordinary scroll. The main difference is in the dye that gives it its unique color.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240720"
            ]
          },
          "150240720": {
            "id": "150240720",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "If my suspicions are correct, this dye is the key to weaving the scroll — and your special ability is the key to obtaining it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240721"
            ]
          },
          "150240721": {
            "id": "150240721",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "The dyeing process is also a little different from the norm, but I don't anticipate any major issues there. As long as you two can source the dye itself, I can assist with the application.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240722"
            ]
          },
          "150240722": {
            "id": "150240722",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "...Cool, we'll follow your lead!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240723"
            ]
          },
          "150240723": {
            "id": "150240723",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Great. Then please use your abilities to source the necessary ingredients, and in the meantime I will have someone prepare some fabric for test-dyeing.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240724"
            ]
          },
          "150240724": {
            "id": "150240724",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "We'll make a few sample pieces to test out my hypothesis, and if that goes well, we can begin the scroll in earnest.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240725"
            ]
          },
          "150240725": {
            "id": "150240725",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "If you agree to help, you can expect to be handsomely rewarded once this is all over. So, what are your thoughts?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240726"
            ]
          },
          "150240726": {
            "id": "150240726",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I think with the ability to help comes the responsibility to do so.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240727"
            ]
          },
          "150240727": {
            "id": "150240727",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Agreed! Especially if there's a reward in it! ...What is the reward, by the way? Is it food? Paimon hopes it's food.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240728"
            ]
          },
          "150240728": {
            "id": "150240728",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Given the stakes involved for our tribe, I was thinking a substantial sum of Mora would be appropriate.... Surely that would be preferable to just a free meal?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240729"
            ]
          },
          "150240729": {
            "id": "150240729",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Mora works too! Anyway, how do we go about finding these ingredients? Or are we supposed to just keep walking around Natlan until we stumble across them...?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240730"
            ]
          },
          "150240730": {
            "id": "150240730",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Thankfully not. I have already identified a location where I suspect they may be found, and I've arranged for someone to guide you there.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150240731"
            ]
          },
          "150240731": {
            "id": "150240731",
            "speakerId": 6250,
            "speakerName": "Biram",
            "text": "Your guide is waiting just outside. You can set off at your leisure."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "1502499",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "150249901"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "150249901": {
            "id": "150249901",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa, check it out, the graffiti on the wall is glowing!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150249902"
            ]
          },
          "150249902": {
            "id": "150249902",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Masters of the Night-Wind... and by the looks of it, masters of nightlife too.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "150249903"
            ]
          },
          "150249903": {
            "id": "150249903",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aha, there IS something hiding here! Yup, this looks like our ticket outta this place!"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ]
}